{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>I shall return there</b> — an allusion to the known grave. And likewise: 'for a time for every matter that is done there' (Ecclesiastes 3:17)." "And some say: 'from my mother's womb' — that is the earth, and the matter refers to the first man, or because the bones, which are the foundation of the body, are from the earth and correspond to the earth."], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:01:30.673582602Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}